@dir src
@brief Folder with C++ source files.

@details
The `src` folder contains the `.cpp` implementation files for the µTest++
library. Each file provides the non-inline method definitions for one or
more related components:

- `check-result.cpp` — `check_result` construction and reporting
- `counters.cpp` — `counters` accumulation and `operator+=`
- `expression-formatter.cpp` — non-template `operator<<` overloads of the
  expression formatter, and the texts of the pending checks
- `runner-options.cpp` — `runner_options` command line parsing, and the
  reporting of the option errors
- `reporter-human.cpp` — human-readable reporter implementation
- `reporter-tap.cpp` — TAP-format reporter implementation
- `reporter.cpp` — base `reporter` class and `operator<<` overloads
- `runner.cpp` — `runner` constructors, option parsing, suite
  registration, `run_suites()`, and `abort()`
- `stopwatch.cpp` — `stopwatch` clock readings and elapsed-time
  computation
- `test.cpp` — `suite`, `top_suite`, `static_suite`, and `test_case`
  lifecycle methods
- `utility.cpp` — `extract_file_name()`, `is_match()`, and `split()`
  helpers
